  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Avian Influenza Control &amp; Human Pandemic Preparedness &amp; Response Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall development objective of the project is to minimize the threat posed to humans and the poultry industry in Georgia by HPAI and other zoonoses in domestic poultry, and to prepare for, control, and respond to influenza pandemics and other infectious disease emergencies in humans.  To achieve this, three areas would be supported by the project: (i) prevention; (ii) preparedness and planning; and (iii) response and containment.</narrative>
  </description>
